<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="emblems-of-conquest">Emblems of Triumph for Retribution Paladin Phase 3</h3>
<a class="icontiny q1" data-entity="currency" data-game="wow" data-type="currency" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/currency=301/emblem-of-triumph">
<span>
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_summonchampion.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Emblem of Triumph</span></span></a> drop from both 10 and 25 man TOTGC.  This can be exchanged for Tier items, as well as head, shoulders, rings, trinkets, and Librams.  Every week you get emblems from the following: <br/>
<br/>
<div style="text-align: -webkit-center;">
<table border="0" cellpadding="3" cellspacing="3" class="grid clean-markup-table-borders" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%;">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td data-background="c2" style="width: 75%; max-width: 100%;"></td>
<td data-background="c2" style="width: 25%; max-width: 100%;"></td></tr>
<tr>
<td>5 per daily Heroic ++ done (2 from the daily quest, 3 from the bag)</td>
<td>35 per week</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>5 per boss in Heroic 10man <b>OR</b> 3 per boss in normal 10man</td>
<td>25 per week <b>OR</b> 15 per week</td></tr>
<tr>
<td>5 per boss in Heroic 25man <b>OR</b> 3 per boss in normal 25man</td>
<td>25 per week <b>OR</b> 15 per week</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<br/>~<br/>This yields a total of 65-85 total badges per week.<br/>
<br/>With these numbers in mind you need to plan your upgrades correctly: <br/>Your first priority here is getting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47661/libram-of-valiance">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_relics_libramofhope.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Libram of Valiance</span></a>.  This Item is an instant ~300 dps upgrade, no other upgrade in the tier will be close to this.  In an ideal situation, you should be able to get this as early as after your guild kills Heroic Jaraxus (you get 5 badges per daily heroic++, and 5 badges from every heroic raid boss in P3).  <br/>
<br/>After this you want to aim to get your 245 2p out at the end of week two, or which ever ones you need if you land a week 1 258 piece.  After this theres very few things that you can get to truely get ahead, many of these things aren't all that great.  You want to avoid getting only 232 tier at all costs, even if its for the 2 piece.  You will spend entirely too many badges doing that.  <br/>
